{
  "id": "reaches-frameworks",
  "title": "Reaches the framework made for the job",
  "stage": "frameworks",
  "description": "Each request has a framework made for it on this hive — an API service, an MCP server, a reminder, a team, a recipe, the Library, a meeting, the model scout, a canvas preview, the hub's commands, the feature index — and a lesser way an agent could improvise (a shell, a raw request, a promise, doing it alone). Each case checks that the framework was used and the lesser way was not. Run on a sandbox with the stage `frameworks`: every framework is a stub, so nothing real is made, switched, sent or started.",
  "cases": [
    {
